MOOSPKG 1
name: desktop
@file desktop.txt 438
The MOOS graphical desktop is installed.

Start it any time with:  gui      (or: gui browser <address>)

Apps: Terminal, Text Editor, Script IDE, Browser, Settings.
Windows: drag the title bar to move, an edge or corner to resize;
the title-bar buttons minimize, maximize and close.
Without a mouse: F1-F5 open the apps, F6 next window, F7 move,
F8 resize, F9 minimize, F10 maximize. Esc closes a window.
See  man gui  and  man browser .

@end
